removeCollateral.tree
├── when market is paused
│   └── it should revert with MarketPaused
└── when market is not paused
    ├── when assets and shares are both zero
    │   └── it should revert with AltoBorrowMarketInvalidInput
    ├── when assets and shares are both non-zero
    │   └── it should revert with AltoBorrowMarketInvalidInput
    ├── when receiver is zero address
    │   └── it should revert with AltoBorrowMarketInvalidInput
    └── when inputs are valid
        ├── given user has insufficient collateral
        │   └── it should revert with AltoBorrowMarketInsufficientCollateral
        ├── given removal would violate max LTV
        │   └── it should revert with AltoBorrowMarketMaxLtvExceeded
        └── given removal is valid
            ├── when data length is zero
            │   ├── it should transfer collateral tokens to receiver
            │   ├── it should decrease position collateralShares
            │   └── it should emit RemoveCollateral event
            ├── when data length is greater than zero and receiver is authorized callback
            │   ├── it should transfer collateral tokens to receiver
            │   ├── it should decrease position collateralShares
            │   ├── it should call onRemoveCollateral callback
            │   └── it should emit RemoveCollateral event
            └── when data length is greater than zero and receiver is not authorized callback
                └── it should revert with AltoBorrowMarketUnauthorized 